# All source code for the GLS synthetic disease generation project lives here.
#
# Subfolders:
# - data/: Data loaders and transforms
# - geometry/: Lesion mask generation algorithms
# - synthesis/: Synthetic dataset creation and rendering
# - gan/: Patch-based GANs for lesion texture (optional)
# - models/: Segmentation and severity regression models
# - evaluation/: Metrics, comparison, and visualization
# - utils/: Logging, plotting, reproducibility helpers
